      "text": "<b><big>מתני'</big></b> <span class=\"bavli-ref\" data-bavli-ref=\"(דף נח:)\" data-bavli-daf=\"58b\" data-bavli-index=\"0\"></span><i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Shulchan Arukh, Even HaEzer\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Appraisals and Devoted Property\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>המקדיש מעשה ידי אשתו הרי היא",
      "segment_ids": [
